<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For God’s dispensing, we have been,</l><l>Made into vessels open to Him;</l><l>His element is wrought in us,</l><l>Making us living stones, corporately;</l><l>Being saved from self, the flesh and its will,</l><l>It’s no longer I, but Christ lives in me;</l><l>Members of the Body, built up in love,</l><l>Joined to be one, for Him corporately.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, as a living sacrifice,</l><l>We will be perfected by Thee</l><l>To build Thy Body, seek increase,</l><l>Lord, the commission now we receive</l><l>In spirit, soul, we’re one for His goal,</l><l>The lampstands to spread His recovery,</l><l>A local being, a global seeing,</l><l>Gospel in hand, the kingdom we’ll preach!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
